      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "抱歉......我听到您刚才说，麦尼尔先生以前也是太阳谷工业的员工？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "骂骂咧咧的矿工",
            "content": "你是那对老夫妇的孙女？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_004_agminea",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "不是不是，算是有一面之缘啦，我和我的同伴以前在这个平台上借宿过。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "麦尼尔先生跟大家都在太阳谷合作过的话，应该很好说话呀，为什么现在看起来关系那么紧张......",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_hesitant",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "骂骂咧咧的矿工",
            "content": "好说话？我们头儿才是好说话！说什么那是她的老前辈，从没这么拉下脸来求人，就带着我们来帮忙。可人家一开始就对老东家意见很大！",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_004_agminea",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "骂骂咧咧的矿工",
            "content": "喏，你看现在，两人在那儿为了怎么下钻头吵半天了。他要是不信我们，还请我们来干嘛？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_004_agminea",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "（唔，原来那两人是为了技术问题而争执，那倒还好说。）",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_thinking",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "（倒是这位先生，带着这样糟糕的心情可不行，得想办法鼓舞士气......）",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_thinking",
            "options": [
              {
                "content": "现场氛围微妙，谨慎说理。",
                "iconId": "ark_odc_act53side_dialog_option_talk",
                "assignments": [
                  {
                    "type": "flag",
                    "data": {
                      "key": "1"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "content": "现场氛围僵硬，大胆鼓励。",
                "iconId": "ark_odc_act53side_dialog_option_talk",
                "assignments": [
                  {
                    "type": "flag",
                    "data": {
                      "key": "2"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "condition": {
          "type": "exist",
          "data": {
            "Type": "exist",
            "key": "1"
          }
        },
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "唔，这位先生，你知不知道，其实有的人，他......",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_pondering",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "condition": {
          "type": "exist",
          "data": {
            "Type": "exist",
            "key": "1"
          }
        },
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "越害羞说话越大声哦。",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_shy",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "condition": {
          "type": "exist",
          "data": {
            "Type": "exist",
            "key": "1"
          }
        },
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "......害羞？",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "骂骂咧咧的矿工",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_004_agminea",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "condition": {
          "type": "exist",
          "data": {
            "Type": "exist",
            "key": "1"
          }
        },
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "用来掩饰一些不想让你观察到的细节啦。麦尼尔先生现在是不是脸红、出汗、声音虚高、动作忸怩，还时不时回头偷看大家？",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_serious",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
